<BehaviorPatch #track.r_2_0_2_6_-_0_8_-_1_3_-_1_1_3_5_-_u_n_i_f_y_-_t_u_i_-_t_u_r_n_-_p_r_o_j_e_c_t_i_o_n_-_a_n_d_-_w_o_r_k_s_p_a_c_e_-_s_c_o_p_e.behavior_patch.tui-questionnaire-continuation apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" version="1" { capability = "tui-questionnaire-continuation" } (
  <Mutations [
    <Upsert { selector = "behavior://tui-questionnaire-continuation/requirements/continuation-uses-typed-turn-projection" } (
      <Requirement #continuation-uses-typed-turn-projection (
        <Statement ?01M05F1PTAX0YYXWFBJ07FMTT1>
        Questionnaire continuation SHALL 把 `resumeTurn` 的 `onControl`、`onChunk` 与 runtime history 全部交给通用 turn surface projector，并在 durable resync 时按稳定 identity reconciliation；continuation MUST NOT 把全部 chunk 硬编码为 assist。
        </?01M05F1PTAX0YYXWFBJ07FMTT1>
        <Suites [
          <Suite #typed-resume { name = "结构化恢复" } (
            <Cases [
              <Case #resume-preserves-categories-and-tool-identity [
                <Then ?01M05F1PTAX0YYXWFBJ07FMTT2>
                类别 SHALL 进入各自 surface，且同一 tool call 只 SHALL 有一个 ToolPart
                </?01M05F1PTAX0YYXWFBJ07FMTT2>
                <Then ?01M05F1PTAX0YYXWFBJ07FMTT3>
                恢复完成后的 conversation resync MUST NOT 复制已显示卡片
                </?01M05F1PTAX0YYXWFBJ07FMTT3>
              ] (
                <Given ?01M05F1PTAX0YYXWFBJ07FMTT4>
                问卷恢复后的 turn 发出 turn、think、toolcall、result、assist 与 done 类别以及同一 toolCallId 的 history events
                </?01M05F1PTAX0YYXWFBJ07FMTT4>
                <When ?01M05F1PTAX0YYXWFBJ07FMTT5>
                TUI 调用 resumeTurn
                </?01M05F1PTAX0YYXWFBJ07FMTT5>
              )>
            ]>
          )>
        ]>
      )>
    )>
  ]>
)>
